bbe essere perfetto"},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Aurelio inherited the wedding-planner trade from his father: he runs the family business, \"The Most Beautiful Day,\" and all his life he has sacrificed his dreams in the name of a mission: to give happiness. Today, however, complicit with the crisis and a divorce behind him, he feels the need for a radical change. He is in love with Serena, an associate of his, and with her he dreams of starting a new life, dropping everything to sail the oceans. Before he can taste freedom, however, Aurelio must resolve two no small matters: selling \"The Most Beautiful Day\" and convincing Serena to divorce Giorgio, who has been Aurelio's fraternal friend since high school."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zr24BSjneXn49aYNOC6CRs5MpFe.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5J6EwgPVQOZy6khKrfuZuThqDG8.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":847574,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zr24BSjneXn49aYNOC6CRs5MpFe.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zr24BSjneXn49aYNOC6CRs5MpFe.jpg","language":"it","width":1312,"height":1969},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zr24BSjneXn49aYNOC6CRs5MpFe.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zr24BSjneXn49aYNOC6CRs5MpFe.jpg","language":"it","width":1312,"height":1969},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1mO4Cs6ZxCAu0aP9pcS5JgXeEed.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1mO4Cs6ZxCAu0aP9pcS5JgXeEed.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"xx":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]}},"background":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/